<mxCell id="a0" value="Limits&#xa;budget, minutes,&#xa;steps; who answers&#xa;when nobody&#xa;watches" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=14;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="34" y="626" width="138" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
